      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 554424206,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I was thinking of adding another dissector like the radiotap dissector to handle the MCS header, but this will do for the moment.\n\nI am told that TamoSoft is being asked to implement use a correct pcapng format with radiotap headers for Wi-Fi packets.",
